message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "WorkingRegime.jl"
abstract: "WorkingRegime.jl reproduces the analyses and figures of the working-regime study. It measures three scaling exponents of cortical dynamics (the diffusion, spectral and variability exponents) in neural recordings from mouse visual cortex, and computes the same exponents for a spiking circuit model and a fractional neural sampling theory."
